              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "institution-disclosures",
                "{{institution_disclosure_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update an existing institution disclosure using its disclosure ID.\n\n```\nPUT /v1/institution-disclosures/{{institution_disclosure_id}}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 Update Institution Disclosure Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Search for Institution Disclosure ID | (Optional) Use this step to find the disclosure ID if it is not already known. |\n| 3 | Update Institution Disclosure | Update the details and status of an existing institution disclosure. |"
    }
